<p>Shadetree is for running a legitimate service business. To keep it safe and reliable for everyone, don't use it to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Send spam or unsolicited messages, or email people who haven't given you a reason to contact them.</li>
  <li>Break the law, including consumer protection, privacy and anti-discrimination laws, or help anyone else do so.</li>
  <li>Upload malware, or content that's illegal, threatening, harassing or infringes someone else's rights.</li>
  <li>Pretend to be someone else, or mislead your clients about who you are.</li>
  <li>Get into accounts or data that aren't yours, probe or overload our systems, or get around limits or security measures. (Found a security problem? Please <%= link_to "tell us", "/.well-known/security.txt" %>.)</li>
  <li>Resell or copy Shadetree, or scrape it.</li>
</ul>
<p>If an account breaks this policy we may limit or suspend it, usually after telling you and giving you a chance to fix it. Where others are at risk (for example, spam sent through our email) we may act first and explain right away.</p>
